<translate>
==== PiercingBullets ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If this parameter is set to true, then the bullets will be able to pass through the target and hit another target behind.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
PiercingBullets = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

